# User Stories

### Create Category

As an Owner,

I want to create a new Category,

So that I can classify my transactions.

---

### Edit Category

As an Owner,

I want to change a Category's name or type,

So that it better fits my needs.

---

### Toggle Category Visibility

As an Owner,

