# Business Rules

## Category

- Every Category belongs to exactly one Household.
- Every Category has a type: "income" or "expense".
- Category names must be unique within a Household and type.

---

## Owner

- Only the Owner can create, edit, and delete Categories.
- Only the Owner can toggle Category visibility.

---

## Member

- Members can only see and use Categories that are visible to them.
- Members cannot create, edit, delete, or toggle visibility of Categories.
- Members cannot see or interact with transactions belonging to hidden Categories.

---

## Visibility

- A Category's default visibility is "visible" (hidden = false).
- When a Category is hidden from Members:
  - Members cannot see the Category in any list.
  - Members cannot select the Category when creating or editing a Transaction.
  - Members cannot see, create, edit, or delete Transactions belonging to that Category.
- Budgets for hidden Categories are still visible to Members.

---

# Functional Requirements

## Create Category

Owner can create a Category by entering:

- Category Name
- Category Type (Income or Expense)
- Visibility (default: visible to Members)

After success:

- Category is created in the Household.
- Category appears in the Category list.

---

## Edit Category

Owner can edit a Category by changing:

- Category Name
- Category Type
- Visibility

After success:

- Category is updated.
- Changes take effect immediately.

---

## Delete Category

Owner can delete a Category.

After success:

- Category is removed from the list.
- Transactions belonging to this Category are NOT deleted (they become uncategorized or remain with old reference — TBD during implementation).

---

## List Categories

The application retrieves all Categories visible to the current user.

- Owner sees all Categories.
- Member sees only visible Categories.

---

# Validation

## Category Name

- Required.
- Minimum 2 characters.
- Maximum 30 characters.
- Trim whitespace before saving.
- Must be unique within the same Household and type.

---

## Category Type

- Required.
- Must be "income" or "expense".

