# Success Criteria

Feature is considered complete when:

- Owner can create a Category.
- Owner can edit a Category name, type, and visibility.
- Owner can delete a Category.
- Owner can toggle Category visibility.
- Member can only see visible Categories.
- Member cannot create, edit, delete, or toggle visibility.
- Member cannot see or interact with transactions on hidden Categories.
- Budgets for hidden Categories are visible to Members.
- Validation works correctly.
- Empty State is available.
- Error State is available.

